<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W MARCH NET UP TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W MARCH NET UP TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.89 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.42 vs   0.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.35 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Sales		   22.93 vs   7.64</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.47 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.40 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.21 vs   1.04</p>
<p> Sales		   45.07 vs  18.84</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
